ory test report for the SV-720; scheduling correspondence.\n\n**Before PTO:** witness engineer's signed test record (§4.3); RTU installed and end-to-end commissioned with live telemetry confirmed by SOC at the moment of request (TCS-02 §3.6, §5) — RTU not allocated (E-1, E-2, E-4 pending). No PTO conditionally against a future test (§4.2).\n\n**Target:** fix the test date in time to report it in the 08/15/2025 League response. Construction complete (punch list closed 06/12/2025); the test does not need to wait for the RTU.	2025-08-15	\N	1	11	9	5	4	\N	\N	2025-07-14	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	t	25	f	\N	\N
