48	1	3	Schedule on-site witness test — Holcott Public Library Array (Selvix SV-720 not carried on CEL-2025-Q2)	**Case:** #45 Process the municipal witness-test waiver batch · **Package:** /DER_Program/Commissioning/Municipal/Municipal_Witness_Test_Package.docx · **Record date:** 07/14/2025\n\n**Array:** Holcott Public Library Array — Town of Holcott, 80 Old Mill Road, Holcott, Alleron 84HO · 510 kW AC (cover sheet) · POI utility secondary, service transformer T-4 · checklist CX-HOL-LIB-01 Rev 0 (06/17/2025; application ID not recorded on checklist)\n\n**Installed inverter:** Selvix SV-720 (cover sheet; footnote cites CEL-2024-Q4).\n\n**Carriage call: NOT CARRIED.** The SV-720 appears only on superseded CEL-2024-Q4 (Inverters row 29, initial listing 10/31/2024) and was not carried forward into CEL-2025-Q2 (eff. 04/30/2025). ENG-PRC-014 Rev 3 §3 (corollaries 3–5) and §4.1: a superseded listing or footnote confers no waiver eligibility → on-site witness test required before PTO.\n\n**Tests (ENG-PRC-014 §4.2, per IEEE 1547.1, minimum):** (1) protective-function trip tests — relay elements against the approved protection coordination study (B-5) and the inverter's voltage/frequency trip functions, magnitude and clearing time; (2) anti-islanding test; (3) ride-through verification, Category II per the approved settings sheets (B-1, B-2).\n\n**Performed by:** Town of Holcott or its commissioning agent — supplies test plan, calibrated instrumentation, qualified operators. **Witnessed by:** Alleniom Utilities witness engineer (§4.2, §4.3). **Scheduled by:** commissioning coordinator, earliest mutually available date (§4.2).\n\n**On file before test day:** checklist re-marked "witness test required" citing CEL-2025-Q2; approved settings sheets and protection coordination study; accepted test plan (stating the SV-720's 720 kW rating and any configured 510 kW limit); instrument identifiers and calibration evidence; operator names; manufacturer certificate of conformance / factory test report for the SV-720; scheduling correspondence.\n\n**Before PTO:** witness engineer's signed test record (§4.3); RTU installed and end-to-end commissioned with live telemetry confirmed by SOC at the moment of request (TCS-02 §3.6, §5) — RTU not allocated (E-1, E-2, E-4 pending). No PTO conditionally against a future test (§4.2).\n\n**Target:** fix the test date in time to report it in the 08/15/2025 League response. Construction complete (punch list closed 06/12/2025); the test does not need to wait for the RTU.	2025-08-15	\N	1	11	9	5	4	0	\N	\N	2026-11-24 22:27:44.97516+00	2026-11-24 22:27:45.034609+00	2025-07-14	\N	\N	1	\N	\N	\N	t	\N	25	f	\N	\N	\N
